ubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/07/04/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/07/04/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/07/04.png" type="image/png" length="82322" /> </item> <item> <title>如何做一场有效的汇报？</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>札记</category> <category>汇报</category> <category>沟通</category> <category>表达技巧</category> <description>如何做一场有效的汇报？从内容设计到表达技巧，系统性地提升汇报能力，让领导听懂、认可并支持你的方案。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/30/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/30/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/30/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/06/30.png" type="image/png" length="57434" /> </item> <item> <title>集成测试流程设计方案</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>AI辅助</category> <category>技术实践</category> <category>流程设计</category> <category>测试</category> <category>集成测试</category> <description>集成测试流程设计方案，明确研发与结对同学的分工协作，建立用例生成、审核、执行的标准化流程</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/15/</link> <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/15/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/15/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/06/15.png" type="image/png" length="59669" /> </item> <item> <title>Go 并发编程：锁与同步的 15 个反模式及正确做法</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>ChainMaker</category> <category>Channel</category> <category>Go</category> <category>反模式</category> <category>并发编程</category> <category>技术实践</category> <category>锁</category> <description>系统梳理 Go 并发编程中锁与同步的 15 个常见反模式及对应正确做法，结合长安链项目中 Stop/Close 机制、stopC 通道、context 级联等真实案例，给出可落地的并发安全准则。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/04/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/04/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/04/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/06/04.png" type="image/png" length="93362" /> </item> <item> <title>Go 并发资源关闭类缺陷排查实战 —— 从一个 SDK 死锁案例说起</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>ChainMaker</category> <category>Channel</category> <category>Go</category> <category>sync.Once</category> <category>并发编程</category> <category>技术实践</category> <category>死锁排查</category> <category>资源管理</category> <category>长安链</category> <description>一个真实的 Go 死锁案例——长安链 SDK-Go ClientConnectionPool.Close() 在重复调用 3 次后必然死锁。本文从问题模型、死锁推演、排查清单、修复范式四个维度系统总结 Go 中 Close/Stop 类方法的常见缺陷，给出可直接复用的排查清单、4 种修复范式、Channel 通知语义对照表和单测最低标准。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/03/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/03/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/03/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/06/03.png" type="image/png" length="87891" /> </item> <item> <title>长安链模块测试 · 实战手册（Module Test Playbook）</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>ChainMaker</category> <category>Go</category> <category>技术实践</category> <category>模块测试</category> <category>测试工程</category> <category>质量保障</category> <category>长安链</category> <description>长安链模块测试实战手册——从认知建立到落地执行的完整方法论。覆盖五件套架构、五大核心范式、6 维场景骨架、零侵入约束，附 store 模块真实案例和可复用模板，帮助研发同学在分钟级反馈内拦截过去只能靠跑链才能发现的 bug。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/27/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/27/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/27/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/05/27.png" type="image/png" length="58108" /> </item> <item> <title>环形缓冲区（Ring Buffer）：从原理到区块链交易去重的实战应用</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>ChainMaker</category> <category>区块链</category> <category>布谷鸟过滤器</category> <category>技术原理</category> <category>数据结构</category> <category>环形缓冲区</category> <description>环形缓冲区（Ring Buffer）是一种固定大小、O(1) 操作、自动淘汰的数据结构。本文从原理出发，结合 ChainMaker BirdsNest 模块的交易去重实战案例，解析环形缓冲区 + 布谷鸟过滤器如何以极低内存开销实现数百万级交易的高效去重。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/26/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/26/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/26/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/05/26.png" type="image/png" length="76555" /> </item> <item> <title>LangChain &amp;amp; LangGraph 学习路线图与水平定位</title> <author>CodeBuddy</author> <category>AI Agent</category> <category>AI开发</category> <category>LangChain</category> <category>LangGraph</category> <category>大模型应用开发</category> <category>学习路线图</category> <description>基于个人测评结果定制的 LangChain &amp; LangGraph 系统学习路线图，涵盖四阶段学习计划、水平定位分析、核心陡峭点识别及专属学习建议，总耗时预估2-3个月，从API调用到复杂决策Agent架构设计。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/07/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 07 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/07/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/07/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/05/07.png" type="image/png" length="80173" /> </item> <item> <title>当趋势策略遇上震荡市：一套全天候复合交易系统的设计手记</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>分步止盈</category> <category>炒股养家</category> <category>策略切换</category> <category>网格交易</category> <category>趋势跟踪</category> <category>量化策略</category> <category>风险管理</category> <description>为什么单一交易策略总是&#34;赚了又赔回去&#34;？一套三层架构的复合交易系统（V2.1），通过战略底仓、趋势跟踪和网格交易的智能协同，让震荡市和单边行情都能从容应对。新增三档阶梯止盈策略，用均线移动止损实现分批落袋与利润奔跑的平衡。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/04/30/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/04/30/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/04/30/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/04/30.png" type="image/png" length="55504" /> </item> <item> <title>AI Prompt 工具箱：不同场景下的实用提示词</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>AI</category> <category>CodeBuddy</category> <category>Prompt</category> <category>工具</category> <category>工程实践</category> <description>记录日常开发中各类场景下实用的 AI Prompt，涵盖 Git 工作流、代码审查、博客写作、性能分析等，持续更新。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/04/15/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 15 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/04/15/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/04/15/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/04/15.png" type="image/png" length="62446" /> </item> <item> <title>Go 优雅退出完全指南：signal.NotifyContext 实战</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>Go</category> <category>Go</category> <category>工程实践</category> <category>进程管理</category> <description>深入解析 Go 语言中利用 signal.NotifyContext 实现优雅退出的标准实践，涵盖 HTTP 服务器、批量任务、带清理的长时间运行任务等典型场景