2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/03/10-1/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/03/10-1/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/03/10-1.png" type="image/png" length="84678" /> </item> <item> <title>一次重复回调引发的库存事故：Go 服务幂等设计实战</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>Go</category> <category>Golang 编程实践</category> <category>分布式系统</category> <category>后端工程</category> <category>幂等设计</category> <description>以支付回调为例，拆解 Go 后端中“防重复执行”的幂等落地方案，覆盖数据模型、事务边界与可观测性实践。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/02/28/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 28 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/02/28/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/02/28/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/02/28.png" type="image/png" length="77084" /> </item> <item> <title>HALO：AI 时代的投资新范式</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>AI</category> <category>投资</category> <category>炒股养家</category> <category>高盛</category> <description>高盛最新报告指出，AI时代的投资逻辑正在发生转变，市场开始奖励重资产、低淘汰率的HALO公司，本文解读这一投资趋势。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/02/25/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 25 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/02/25/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/02/25/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/02/25.png" type="image/png" length="60455" /> </item> <item> <title>高性能滑动窗口缓存设计：环形缓冲区 + 分片锁</title> <author>CodeBuddy</author> <category>Golang</category> <category>Golang 编程实践</category> <category>并发</category> <category>数据结构</category> <category>缓存</category> <description>设计一个高性能的滑动窗口缓存，使用环形缓冲区和分片锁实现 O(1) 查询和高并发写入。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/02/12/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/02/12/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/02/12/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/02/12.png" type="image/png" length="64009" /> </item> </channel> </rss>